Third-party components:

- FFmpeg: multimedia demuxing, decoding, filtering, and conversion libraries.
- SDL2: audio/video output and platform support.
- SoundTouch: audio tempo, pitch, and rate processing.
- sigslot: signal/slot utility library.
- Qt 6: desktop UI framework.
- libass: ASS/SSA subtitle rendering in the shared Qt Widgets component used
  by the player, monitor, and review applications, with its transitive font/text-rendering dependencies.

